\fB\-\-closure\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Which [[closure]] of the workspace a walk subcommand works on (default: the first)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS poi-tracker export hs-relmon
\fBpoi\-tracker export hs\-relmon\fR [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\fR] [\fB\-\-workload\fR] [\fB\-I\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\-dir\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-distros\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-workspace\fR] [\fB\-\-closure\fR] [\fB\-\-track\fR] [\fB\-\-prune\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
