.SS poi-tracker unkeep
\fBpoi\-tracker unkeep\fR <\fB\-\-graph\fR> [\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\fR] [\fB\-\-deps\fR] [\fB\-I\fR|\fB\-\-inventory\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-workspace\fR] [\fB\-\-closure\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.PP
